        "232",
        "1565"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e2609e283e93712d9366b45c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "Thanks！　果然赛事最开心了！\n心灵之间炙热的碰撞，我已经完全沦陷了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c5cf4458e4ee8a9ca883cf02a9da04c8aca351c744bf6c0c619ba7d42d3a9ab",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1566"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe8ce911a42fd74dfe3e67b8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我要去爬行动物咖啡馆！　蛇还有鬣蜥，\n那冰凉鳞片的触感……总是能治愈我呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "9313fbf794a99a4ae8e523c9af5cb3def9fe4a1882f4074a017b37bb0439567d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1567"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6e6af6de4d45edf3cb7f287",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "给远在美国的妈妈！　话虽如此，现在\n在观众席上的爸爸应该已经打过去了吧。呵呵！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0187c37802a8b04ba28a17b9ae6ccaf54e0b2d174191b7dda963f2eeeecfcb83",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1568"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:09e51cadb782ce7c05b62d92",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "Indeed，我会把身体和精神锻炼得比现在更强\n给你看。首先……去深山里闭关特训吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b9a9cc99117001cc9828176c9c6b970c7c2dd749197db541d9fc9ece8c15b1b5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1569"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca30c7ff2e41dfef6b257a78",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "要说作战……其实就跟平常一样，\\n总之不把前头让给任何人，尽力向前跑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e6a2f9e68cba489ce3b59dc87ea9fbca6ae02de15d1618c66471342ba6dbb4ec",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "157"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:90ff9820f70cdc2d6404c2f2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "即便是在大舞台上，my heart也不会动摇！\n因为一直，都有默默支持着我的人在嘛♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "9602e362a63c4a388e18b7f0a58203e3d7b94bc3ff7d4e00f900edd5316db13b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1570"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66711caa9b125851d06aa7c3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "给远在美国的妈妈！　话虽如此，现在\n在观众席上的爸爸应该已经打过去了吧。呵呵！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0187c37802a8b04ba28a17b9ae6ccaf54e0b2d174191b7dda963f2eeeecfcb83",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1571"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:345ddba0ea735cd1e93d1e54",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "Indeed，我会把身体和精神锻炼得比现在更强\n给你看。首先……去深山里闭关特训吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b9a9cc99117001cc9828176c9c6b970c7c2dd749197db541d9fc9ece8c15b1b5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1572"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:64248479f4cccdaed96d9ae1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "即便是在大舞台上，my heart也不会动摇！\n因为一直，都有默默支持着我的人在嘛♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "9602e362a63c4a388e18b7f0a58203e3d7b94bc3ff7d4e00f900edd5316db13b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1573"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95422e90898cd20f4c8bd58c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "Of course！　接下来要开3天的派对呢！\n不让大家的目光钉在我的舞姿上可不行呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "8cd09d2454eba3b559a4767977eb38c56cdf97c62c53626d7ea91948ae6b7387",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1574"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88e6349bd2cc30025a332048",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "女王的跑姿，已经深深烙印在你们的眼里了吧？\n闪耀的我，今后也要尽情地注视着哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "502b644bfb7a94bbbf4cf7704fe072d30bb8793de8db75382a9a4a8e7c4dbeeb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1575"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c2b9b818c66430e288f37d3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "Of course！　接下来要开3天的派对呢！\n不让大家的目光钉在我的舞姿上可不行呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "8cd09d2454eba3b559a4767977eb38c56cdf97c62c53626d7ea91948ae6b7387",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1576"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fcd4d1671f75f92fb7d7cc55",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "女王的跑姿，已经深深烙印在你们的眼里了吧？\n闪耀的我，今后也要尽情地注视着哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "502b644bfb7a94bbbf4cf7704fe072d30bb8793de8db75382a9a4a8e7c4dbeeb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1577"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2b91d444af0a01dfa1a73ff",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "胜利会自己向我走来的吧。在故事的最后\n带来光明的，必然是身为圣女的我。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6707e8e8c735e8ee75ca880e344d2742fd4189156b78738773d061b74e38d2f9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1578"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f8c4a5e4c01d506cf47dab3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那是带来神圣光芒的力量。净化邪恶、\n拯救世界的光辉，下一场赛事也请继续见证。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c3860ce0c6f9910a12fa07e43037b360b971385ff7dbd38f33dbbe426e688d7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1579"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca6e15578032f60f66c197df",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我看到了令人想就那样不断跑下去……\\n既新奇又亮眼的景色。",
      "source_fingerprint": "45905bf071364d583207bb63c38e480c4e24fed2e92706a438f38273fbe7cd99",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "158"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f933f33d7f74524274296971",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我想和粉丝们一起分享热腾腾的炖菜。\n与人分享，正是圣女的本愿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e0d5befdf03365b2f70dcc7fa367e1991755a905d6ca0b20d533ffd8564b84a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1580"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:226bc07ad7824cd810a13de4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我只是循着光明的轨迹前进罢了。\n我能看得很清楚……因为我是圣女嘛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4b7030bf3dc300cd88f8191d55a36b86b7d6c3701b1f0cdb68444e4a55f84c8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1581"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1df1af109ba05f3400346690",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在克服困难感到满足的同时，我也感到战栗。\n为了能够迎接更为艰险的试炼……决赛而欣喜！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5827b819cf96daeb40d6994541b1da408e549a5c619a78951ef980f4afa35ec4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1582"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:646d8c1264de5c594a532559",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我想和粉丝们一起分享热腾腾的炖菜。\n与人分享，正是圣女的本愿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e0d5befdf03365b2f70dcc7fa367e1991755a905d6ca0b20d533ffd8564b84a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1583"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4bcc60832c1b51b50d45afe5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我只是循着光明的轨迹前进罢了。\n我能看得很清楚……因为我是圣女嘛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4b7030bf3dc300cd88f8191d55a36b86b7d6c3701b1f0cdb68444e4a55f84c8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1584"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cdc29c70eb0f4ecd4f51f854",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在克服困难感到满足的同时，我也感到战栗。\n为了能够迎接更为艰险的试炼……决赛而欣喜！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5827b819cf96daeb40d6994541b1da408e549a5c619a78951ef980f4afa35ec4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1585"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72090f476d72bd44ef58c0a9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "拜托请找伏特加小姐。\n……还有，能不能改成定期连载呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "42ea02e321ef44db5ca8884516324d45ff91b9f7f0ff0a0456856601b48a9ff2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1586"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:99e53ff9bf34d5cd9e298db6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请环顾四周。这就是我和训练员\n照亮的世界的样子——是多么耀眼而尊贵啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "57370b796466eb00251b9dbc7b9f6757060ddd93ab65683fc672bb6f4a152f31",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1587"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ce6b15d16cd1c081b6dee54",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "拜托请找伏特加小姐。\n……还有，能不能改成定期连载呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "42ea02e321ef44db5ca8884516324d45ff91b9f7f0ff0a0456856601b48a9ff2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1588"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f0d15b4294c823ef3a5ab74f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请环顾四周。这就是我和训练员\n照亮的世界的样子——是多么耀眼而尊贵啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "57370b796466eb00251b9dbc7b9f6757060ddd93ab65683fc672bb6f4a152f31",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1589"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8c1ce4af66942e117ec76e2e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那当然是让其他人全都相形失色的……\\n没事！会长在瞪我！",
      "source_fingerprint": "270e204e99cb67ed9dc1858ea7d609d62ca2cf91a2dfbf7d5e01fb3e5fd941ee",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "159"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b04e9ee3fc8136d782cd2f11",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "为了让心情平静下来，想去植物园……。\n触碰到泥土的香气——就会被治愈呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "adc3d6fcd7bc7456b49e2c61b086da740675d59700f6bdab41772b3f35c8a261",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1590"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a709e3333f37cdd4587b593",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "为了能将胜利的一朵鲜花——交到您手上……。\n我会去挑战的。带着坚定的——必胜的决心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f489c4d0f390d42dc333e33bd9de27b090a36d70631f72688feef7ad84d08fe6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1591"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db1f4abdcbd8bb8c34a465f7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不可思议的是，没怎么感到……。大概是因为\n我相信着训练员倾注的心血吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e301e315a321142aee2d11f76082e569e477296be2ea955afd1282d2bd06f39c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1592"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4dc944c7a7e87fb6f3bc2bf6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "想起了事前的——训练员的，指导。\n感觉就像是我们在共同奔跑一样……令人非常安心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2553cbc83861206e70e438c3fe9194b69bd357b1a984861f0681b6b6ebf6161f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1593"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f708f88c556f4b5f02b67e1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "和青梅竹马一起吃了——很『可爱』的松饼。\n食用花，真的很招人喜欢呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "21160e0df0ce093fcc724658f5daec8b6fa28e5bef6ebfa11f6f4e083072e2ab",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1594"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:970771ed9d2eb4849099003a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不可思议的是，没怎么感到……。大概是因为\n我相信着训练员倾注的心血吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e301e315a321142aee2d11f76082e569e477296be2ea955afd1282d2bd06f39c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1595"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5fe1d717d4be5ca8ab6a58af",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "想起了事前的——训练员的，指导。\n感觉就像是我们在共同奔跑一样……令人非常安心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2553cbc83861206e70e438c3fe9194b69bd357b1a984861f0681b6b6ebf6161f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1596"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ed380b6d1dceac2485d4a54",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "和青梅竹马一起吃了——很『可爱』的松饼。\n食用花，真的很招人喜欢呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "21160e0df0ce093fcc724658f5daec8b6fa28e5bef6ebfa11f6f4e083072e2ab",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1597"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:61f60566512e8b0771c10c73",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "感觉就像是，看到了——月下美人的开花。\n喜出望外。能去挑战，真是太好了……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f527c0aabf4b005eb13fa5093a37e11d810b421f7b21acd88e715598c3808014",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1598"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc8f0d119282f6d4a1a0e8c5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "就是能带回一朵足以献给训练员伟大功绩的——\n充满价值的胜利之花。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc5681f4f182c99d7f4e13d11807e56022db6257728aa67e14a958238b350032",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1599"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:03085cda380e1e3b82c34708",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "像是并跑练习和比拚耐力……\\n呃，为什么脑中浮现的都是那家伙啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7bd88ede45868425ec9557b2ac2fdc522c6d54db5917ed1df896d7fdfb0cf321",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "16"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad4aad7e250340043863ebdf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "没错，这只不过是其中的一页！\\n这位记者说得很好～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b1042e0956ad510e4455e3797197deee702b18031ebaea1915189dae0d68e0b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "160"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77a5177430b9247d4bb1bcc8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "感觉就像是，看到了——月下美人的开花。\n喜出望外。能去挑战，真是太好了……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f527c0aabf4b005eb13fa5093a37e11d810b421f7b21acd88e715598c3808014",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1600"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f30a5daa5884d311ba357615",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "就是能带回一朵足以献给训练员伟大功绩的——\n充满价值的胜利之花。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc5681f4f182c99d7f4e13d11807e56022db6257728aa67e14a958238b350032",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1601"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:530bd01460aa8554c74c2e85",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是啊……\\n就当是『早已备好的第一名』吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "10d72c6aa3cf9956725a360f4d0b9fc5438d01f64368eabba47fd8a79ccfdb34",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1602"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:43b4f68e6f64ed1634b3d167",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "赛道适应性极高的对手、激烈的并驾齐驱，\\n还有闸门……真是场费劲的战斗啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "825b04e2cb593933b7195cdd2b2a457077d390a22905b2a38c29dc0508f7bddf",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1603"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:904546cc50ae206a9a0b021e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "战略的基本，就是先定好终点……\\n在决定出赛时就已经拜托训练员了",
      "source_fingerprint": "a7094968364bdef3ee4ffe9da0d1d7dfcd310a8f312a67c9d9831edc5aaec5c6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1604"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b25637c2c073b97055c8f5ba",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "缜密的战略、灵活的应变能力，诸如此类有很多……\\n但最重要的还是掌控“全场”的能力，吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "23a9324d0d8e9504b1200a7f50daa5d31e3ec14e558dda1377d11992d007e485",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1605"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:186e769e667cd3ec7d96d6c5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "终于从魔鬼训练中解放了……\\n网游解禁啦。庆功大会一定要来参加啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b95a98775372f1e5cd8643d32c207d49ddd83348a5a3491045afd4691f7dcff8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1606"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0fe9668e3e4fa7cd95a9b415",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "战略的基本，就是先定好终点……\\n在决定出赛时就已经拜托训练员了",
      "source_fingerprint": "a7094968364bdef3ee4ffe9da0d1d7dfcd310a8f312a67c9d9831edc5aaec5c6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1607"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:372dc63d10511c62752d3466",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "缜密的战略、灵活的应变能力，诸如此类有很多……\\n但最重要的还是掌控“全场”的能力，吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "23a9324d0d8e9504b1200a7f50daa5d31e3ec14e558dda1377d11992d007e485",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1608"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97d434097aab5d8280a6c752",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "终于从魔鬼训练中解放了……\\n网游解禁啦。庆功大会一定要来参加啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b95a98775372f1e5cd8643d32c207d49ddd83348a5a3491045afd4691f7dcff8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1609"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f8329bb5c548286e5f05fc3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我要赢过在场所有的赛马娘，\\n证明能拿下优胜的「绝对会是我」喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9fc57e54dd4aca2bf32012609b4808ce0b77a4dc6f2ea84c46d7893b4b373ab9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "161"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c57fce736e357eeee4446dfc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "啊――――哈哈，果然最棒了啊！\\n这种将整场比赛尽握掌中的感觉！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d4b321c212367ff4f0c3f62212ce1959063ccff91bdb828fb0282688d2d5409",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1610"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:04fabcb269d16e49e8d1f728",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哈哈，我的左膀右臂可是我的头号粉丝啊。\\n……能展现出最棒的比赛真是太好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "14f9f5bb2b2f981271a9d488f4c8373e0de5bdd3bbd514b49c4acd08384b2f21",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1611"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e8b4cfcb452bf4748d3dd72",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "啊――――哈哈，果然最棒了啊！\\n这种将整场比赛尽握掌中的感觉！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d4b321c212367ff4f0c3f62212ce1959063ccff91bdb828fb0282688d2d5409",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1612"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b624ebb495460960f3b28307",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哈哈，我的左膀右臂可是我的头号粉丝啊。\\n……能展现出最棒的比赛真是太好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "14f9f5bb2b2f981271a9d488f4c8373e0de5bdd3bbd514b49c4acd08384b2f21",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1613"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4076cf0badc9dc3288cb89e3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "（跑回来）……抱歉！　是要提问对吧！\\n我一跑起来总是刹不住车啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3a30fd13821901ac4d5185f41e143bc2ade779449106cfe8f0020da0922b0e5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1614"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4d0f54b12d1fe824d018211",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我约了西沙里奥和吉兆，一起吃了好多\\n午餐哦！　精力瞬间加满了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c0d364e761fc7e37996715187bf1cf1bd5b4c3997d85faff2a6dfe7658e3b22d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1615"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:68d3edb766afa81ec99ebf35",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "决心？　那还用说，只有一个！\\n我会赢！　命运之声也是这么说的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9742a3c71a885a27a0ae6df58792870fadf0e2f3f24291619fa7e49e221e76bc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1616"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5db7409c5cb6ef94b3ed2528",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "刚才我们还在那儿一起欢呼雀跃呢！\\n大概是因为击掌之后又冲着跑了一段台阶吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ab03c384719a95e47d975cf9ea480122fae7d6b915ee0441886c88383d60d6a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1617"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af3ba26b1d3a067d650b2b0b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哎呀，真是太开心了！　大家的“呼声”，\\n毫无疑问成了我的助力。谢谢大家！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c1fd602dc9d576f09d55dfc3d62e9427f710c412d424a7f739bcc2de04b0da4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1618"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ac76f0fd2061f054c2087d0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "决心？　那还用说，只有一个！\\n我会赢！　命运之声也是这么说的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9742a3c71a885a27a0ae6df58792870fadf0e2f3f24291619fa7e49e221e76bc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1619"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fbee6dcbefbb808f4f1acae4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "好耀眼！努力不懈的小妹妹们都好可爱，\\n让姐姐我感到很温馨呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "dcb7a55352268769ae842d80016583650794ea1f28e487dab0a45dbc3fa2d8fc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "162"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:74d44f3499b829338d690ed4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "刚才我们还在那儿一起欢呼雀跃呢！\\n大概是因为击掌之后又冲着跑了一段台阶吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ab03c384719a95e47d975cf9ea480122fae7d6b915ee0441886c88383d60d6a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
